OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Facross England and Wales tending to
OL,7,Fease away this evening, to leave a
OL,8,Flargely dry and clear night. Scotland
OL,9,Fand Northern Ireland though will see
OL,10,Ffurther cloud and some outbreaks of
OL,11,Frain. A mild night to come for most.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FApart from a few showers many
OL,14,Fsouthern areas will be dry with sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Cloudier further north with a
OL,16,Fband of rain moving southwards
OL,17,Fthroughout the day. Temperatures near
OL,18,Faverage.
